B.aFP=new A.fC("ATS based Kerr-Cat Qubit","Participated in the research, design and development of **Asymmetrically Threaded SQUIDs (ATS)**-based Superconducting Kerr Cat Qubits. As a Sub-Team Lead, of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, Q3D, and KQLayout** for quantum circuit development. Under the supervision of **Dr. Shantanu Jha** and **Mr. Muhammad Waqar Amin**. ",u.E,"Intern,Sub Team Lead",null)
B.aFR=new A.fC("Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium","Participated in the resarch, design and development of **Fluxonium-Transmon-Fluxonium (FTF)**-based Superconducting Qubits.With implementation of **Qiskit-Metal, Ansys HFSS, KQLayout, and QuTip** for quantum circuit development. My work focused on optimizing circuit parameters to enhance coherence and gate performance, contributing to advancements in superconducting qubit architectures.",u.E," Team-Lead, Remote Hackathon",null)
