B.aFI=new A.fC("NotePad Application","As part of my **Second-Semester** project, I developed a Notepad application entirely from **scratch** without using any **external libraries**. This application includes essential features such as **saving and editing** text files, along with **password security and encryption** to ensure data privacy. ","C/C++","Second Year Project","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/console-based-notepad")
B.aFH=new A.fC("DBScan Algorithm","Implemented the **DBScan (Density-Based Spatial Clustering of Applications with Noise)** algorithm entirely from **scratch without using any external libraries**. This project involved developing the core **clustering logic**, **handling noise points**, and **optimizing performance** for efficient density-based clustering.","Python","AI Mini Project","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/DBSCAN-Algorithm")
B.aFS=new A.fC("Cows and Bulls","Randomly generate a 4-digit number. Ask the user to guess a 4-digit number.For every digit the user guessed correctly in the correct place, they have a 'cow'. For every digit the user guessed correctly in the wrong place is a 'bull.'Every time the user makes a guess, tell them how many \u201ccows\u201d and 'bulls'they have. Once the user guesses the correct number, the game is over. Keep track of the number of guesses the user makes throughout the game and tell the user at the end.","C/C++","Personal Endeavor","https://github.com/Risav25Pokhrel/console-based-cows-and-bulls-using-C-/blob/main/cowandbull.cpp")
